        "text": "Hi Mum, it's Jack. I am in Spain! We are in a small hotel near the beach. The weather is hot and sunny. Yesterday we went to the beach and swam in the sea. Today we are visiting an old castle in the town. It costs ten euros for each person. Tomorrow we are taking a boat trip. We are leaving at nine in the morning, so I must get up early! The food here is very good. I eat fish and rice every day. My friend Tom does not like fish, so he eats chicken. We are flying home on Friday. The plane leaves at four o'clock in the afternoon. Can you pick us up from the airport? Please call me back tonight. I miss you. Bye!"
